  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>A Fleur de Chiens, on avenue Janvier Passero in Mandelieu-la-Napoule, is a grooming salon for dogs and cats. Its Facebook page says "20 years at your service in Mandelieu" and names Mandelieu-la-Napoule, Théoule-sur-Mer, Cannes and Auribeau-sur-Siagne among the towns it serves.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Animals: dogs and cats ("beauty care for dogs and cats", Facebook page).</li>
        <li>Phone: 04 92 97 89 32, shown on the salon's Facebook page.</li>
        <li>Hours from directories: Tuesday to Friday, from 9am; closed on Monday and at weekends.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Check before you go: the hours come from directories that disagree on closing time (5pm or 5:30pm); the salon has no website, and its prices and detailed services are not published on the pages read. Call 04 92 97 89 32 to book an appointment.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: call before coming to set an appointment and confirm the closing time.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The salon is in Mandelieu-la-Napoule, between Cannes and the Estérel.</p>

      <h2>Sources</h2>
      <p>"A Fleur De Chiens" Facebook page, Cylex, Wheree and mairie.com (consulted on 08/11/2026).</p>
